// Sign in with AssemblyAI, for the Debug and Debug-Local configurations
// (see `configFiles` in project.yml). Release signs in to production instead,
// from SignIn.release.xcconfig.
//
// The values themselves are not in this repo: they name AssemblyAI's sandbox
// deployments. Copy SignIn.local.xcconfig.example to SignIn.local.xcconfig
// (gitignored) and fill it in; without it, dev builds simply don't show
// sign-in.
#include? "SignIn.local.xcconfig"
